<main class="zd-roadmap-page">

  <section class="zd-roadmap-hero">
    <p class="zd-roadmap-eyebrow">Roadmap</p>

    <h1>Follow the build from idea to launch.</h1>

    <p>
      This roadmap shows what Ziyu Development is building now, what comes next,
      and how each project connects into the larger intentional living ecosystem.
    </p>

    <div class="zd-roadmap-actions">
      <a href="/pages/support" class="zd-roadmap-btn zd-roadmap-btn--primary">Support the Mission</a>
      <a href="/pages/projects" class="zd-roadmap-btn zd-roadmap-btn--secondary">Explore Projects</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-roadmap-current">
    <div>
      <p class="zd-roadmap-eyebrow">Current focus</p>
      <h2>Building the foundation.</h2>
    </div>

    <p>
      The current stage is focused on the brand system, Shopify website,
      app direction, product structure, project pages, and the first Goal Grower
      prototype experience.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-roadmap-timeline">

    <article class="zd-roadmap-item">
      <div class="zd-roadmap-marker">01</div>
      <div class="zd-roadmap-card">
        <span>Now</span>
        <h2>Website + Brand Foundation</h2>
        <p>
          Build the Ziyu Development site, visual system, core pages,
          project pages, support page, store structure, and journal foundation.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Homepage</li>
          <li>Projects hub</li>
          <li>Project detail pages</li>
          <li>Support the Mission page</li>
          <li>Store foundation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="zd-roadmap-item">
      <div class="zd-roadmap-marker">02</div>
      <div class="zd-roadmap-card">
        <span>Next</span>
        <h2>Goal Grower Prototype</h2>
        <p>
          Create the first functional version of Goal Grower with goals,
          habit tracking, visual plant growth, and simple progress logging.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Goal creation</li>
          <li>Daily progress logging</li>
          <li>Plant growth states</li>
          <li>Basic dashboard</li>
          <li>Early tester feedback</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="zd-roadmap-item">
      <div class="zd-roadmap-marker">03</div>
      <div class="zd-roadmap-card">
        <span>After Goal Grower MVP</span>
        <h2>Accountability + Shared Gardens</h2>
        <p>
          Expand Goal Grower with accountability partners, shared gardens,
          goal privacy options, and community-based motivation.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Invite accountability partners</li>
          <li>Shared gardens</li>
          <li>Private/public goal controls</li>
          <li>Friend progress views</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="zd-roadmap-item">
      <div class="zd-roadmap-marker">04</div>
      <div class="zd-roadmap-card">
        <span>Future</span>
        <h2>MyJourney</h2>
        <p>
          Build a life-design system that helps users organize goals,
          habits, reflection, planning, and personal growth into one calm place.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Life dashboard</li>
          <li>Daily planning</li>
          <li>Reflection prompts</li>
          <li>Journey map</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="zd-roadmap-item">
      <div class="zd-roadmap-marker">05</div>
      <div class="zd-roadmap-card zd-roadmap-card--dark">
        <span>Future</span>
        <h2>Blokkr</h2>
        <p>
          Develop the focus and distraction-blocking tool that protects attention
          and helps users create intentional distance from noisy apps.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Focus sessions</li>
          <li>App blocking</li>
          <li>Schedules</li>
          <li>Focus reports</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="zd-roadmap-item">
      <div class="zd-roadmap-marker">06</div>
      <div class="zd-roadmap-card">
        <span>Future</span>
        <h2>Kindlitt</h2>
        <p>
          Create a reading and clean-information platform for curated books,
          thoughtful recommendations, and meaningful reading lists.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Book discovery</li>
          <li>Curated lists</li>
          <li>Reading profiles</li>
          <li>Community recommendations</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="zd-roadmap-item">
      <div class="zd-roadmap-marker">07</div>
      <div class="zd-roadmap-card">
        <span>Long term</span>
        <h2>Connected Ecosystem</h2>
        <p>
          Connect apps, content, products, community, and support into one
          intentional living ecosystem.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Connected accounts</li>
          <li>Shared user dashboard</li>
          <li>Community challenges</li>
          <li>Physical + digital product bundles</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

  </section>

  <section class="zd-roadmap-support">
    <div>
      <p class="zd-roadmap-eyebrow">Help make it real</p>
      <h2>Support moves the roadmap forward.</h2>
      <p>
        Every purchase, share, email signup, and supporter helps turn these
        projects from plans into real products.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href="/pages/support" class="zd-roadmap-btn zd-roadmap-btn--light">
      Support the Mission
    </a>
  </section>

</main>

